      ],
      "notes": [
        "The deployment check validates component enumeration and preserves disabled reasons; it does not claim a requested event can be measured.",
        "The source-built 7.2.0 prefix and APT papi-tools 7.1.0 are separate versions; select an explicit command/library pair.",
